.SH "Detailed Description"
.PP 

.PP
.nf
A Beautiful soup `bs4\&.builder\&.TreeBuilder` that uses the
:py:class:`html\&.parser\&.HTMLParser` parser, found in the Python
standard library\&.
.fi
